    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Long Island University Brooklyn offers on-campus housing that gives students a traditional university experience. The Podiatry Residence Hall, the Schwartz Hall, and the Williams Hall are conventional residence halls offering single-triple occupancy rooms and communal spaces.</p><p>Students can opt for apartment-style living by applying to 113 Flatbush Avenue Residence Hall. Students can enjoy furnished studio or one-bedroom apartments with a full kitchen, bathroom, and living area. St. George Residence offers furnished one and two-bedroom apartments with a shared living room and kitchenette.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
